{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e5eca7d11c209e7af9526c0b558422b9ee47be8a659f3d5e4526edd4b782d62", "ja": "（未来のリゾートウェディングの撮影が無事終わった。\nこの後は、ライブイベントがあるけど……）", "zh": "（未来顺利完成了度假婚礼的拍摄，\n接下来还有演唱会的活动……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "b7d12a587b2b966734ea159e48eef9900e7e7f31da2ca88f9e0e931506a33cae", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん、見てください！\nカニがいますよ！　ホントに本物の海なんだ～♪", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，你看！\n有螃蟹！是真正的大海耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "e2b7dfd5092693de682b81a7709c527b3bcd0653b7405dd774fc1c0d5f1f2c6b", "ja": "式場からすぐ本物のビーチに出られるなんて、\nなんかスゴいですよね～。", "zh": "走出会场马上就能到真正的沙滩，\n感觉真厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d107463421e7e8b37d77a35d1251262d9b96fc39fa750216e471010d1b359476", "ja": "うん、流石はリゾートウェディングだな。\nところで未来、そろそろライブだけど緊張してないか？", "zh": "嗯，不愧是度假婚礼。\n话说未来，差不多要到演唱会的时间了，你不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "d73986c4bfdc4cbdde79653bad786eb6fc0601257dd4541bd213493bda4dc2e2", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です！　それより、結婚式場で\n歌えるのが、すっごく楽しみで……えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯，不会！比起紧张，\n我更期待可以在婚礼会场唱歌呢……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e48067b81a5de5e200e1681789ce6eaa83e32b82bbe8def65db893e7e45603dc", "ja": "なら良かった。ウェディングフェアの\nお客さん達も、楽しんでくれるといいな。", "zh": "那就好，希望来看婚纱展的\n客人们也能好好享受一番呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "ffac7d632d8d23df6c6e17d9a1dfe1eaa0ae4a6bacdbd45bcf2cdbeca8ecc77b", "ja": "はい、がんばりまーす！　みんながもっともっと\n幸せになっちゃうように、張りきって歌いますね♪", "zh": "嗯，我会加油的～！我会鼓足干劲，\n努力唱歌带给大家更多更多的幸福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "8ab1750ae7cb1a63559ad56f789958f08d4f1c36f048d7cecedc00d94cab8da4", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん、今回のお仕事って、\n私でよかったんですか？", "zh": "不过{$P$}先生，这次的工作，\n交给我没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "9cbfd7ebb61c25481e9c1b9131b645d66ebdce5ee68316886358693065b9682e", "ja": "私、まだ14歳だし……結婚とかできませんよ？", "zh": "我只有14岁……也还不能结婚喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4154e848601846b86109b210aeb39de45bf6413d0d95d1e8bd5ad607fd12a823", "ja": "結婚できる年齢じゃなくちゃ、ダメって事はないよ。\n今回は未来だからこそできる事をしてほしかったんだ。", "zh": "这份工作跟年龄能否结婚是没有关系的。\n这次会找未来是因为有些事情只有你才办得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "bfed9e6823e7180a092f1a36bde694d82b559aa4dff8bb823fe0fe47f62ac2b0", "ja": "私だからこそできること……ですか？", "zh": "只有我才办得到的事情吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f6536d186ec9a9329bb5272b028c267f0d6c2a636575503ac8c4cfbfb2a151e5", "ja": "うん。今の未来が持ってる、花嫁さんへの純粋な\n憧れを表現してほしかった……って言えばいいのかな。", "zh": "没错，应该这么说吧……我希望未来可以表现出\n自己现阶段单纯对新娘子的向往……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "1755fbe30d5927cb645e42404fd9e8e0ac94e3adead82a4f94765d03575abedc", "ja": "純粋な憧れ……。そりゃあ、ウェディングドレスとか\nとってもステキだな～って思いますけど……。", "zh": "单纯的向往……人家确实是觉得\n婚纱之类的东西很美没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "853232781fb3fbf375b454c07e10a182663371e2855ec582ac2e3bf86ff78de0", "ja": "でもでも！　私、結婚する自分なんて、\n全然想像できないですよ～！？", "zh": "可是可是！\n我完全想像不出来自己结婚的样子啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1014_p", "source_sha256": "122f9d470b294f0f3f4fc7930f063b854779b1738e70b5cb84cbd9b9a22051e4", "ja": "それは当然だよ、未来はまだ14歳だしな。\nそんなに、難しく考えなくていいんだ。", "zh": "这是当然的啊，毕竟未来你只有14岁，\n用不着想得这么复杂啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "d847411012c3a4242d06f03979d17a8955e59a21b528760a55a0b7f37be99a80", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、ドレスがキレイでステキ！とか、\nブーケがキレイとか、そんなことでもいいんですか？", "zh": "那么那么，觉得婚纱很美很棒！或是捧花很漂亮\n之类的，我只有这些想法，这样也没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1016_p", "source_sha256": "aef044abd8abfc394fb4240dee26eb733d8ddf50b1c4b70012973773f35ea3a1", "ja": "うん、それで十分だ！　未来を見てくれた人達が、\nあんなキレイなドレスを着たいって思ったり……。", "zh": "嗯，这样就够了！说不定看到未来的人们，\n会产生想穿漂亮婚纱的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8a0c4c2cc3f28653acf3587fa833027299c244695134ac5f7263d9ba8fe89930", "ja": "未来みたいに、楽しそうな笑顔の花嫁になりたい、って\n思うかもしれないしな！", "zh": "或者是想成为像未来那样，\n笑得如此开怀的新娘子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "fdb628664a54fb57f36912a8ccda010a70ae17c9bea6b8b715f661c6b622fb00", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nはいっ！　春日未来、よ～くわかりましたっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n好！春日未来，已经非～常清楚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "fc00f871e76ac6e338a7d5e842c8e9dd02ed52329f2201768c8edcc8385e20d6", "ja": "楽しくするなら、まかせてください！　この後の\nライブも、目いっぱい楽しんできちゃいますね♪", "zh": "如果是要开心工作，那就包在我身上！\n接下来的演唱会，我也会尽情去享受的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0134_1020_p", "source_sha256": "43961691aef635c551543318ef599b28da7b581a424ea324433a33572615f21b", "ja": "（そう言った未来の笑顔は、眩しいくらい輝いていた。\nこの笑顔なら、お客さん達にも届くだろう……！）", "zh": "（未来这么说完，露出了灿烂无比的笑容。\n如果是这个笑容，一定也能传达给观众们的……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
